- Variant handling: Python 3.8 compatibility precludes match/case; closed Enum identity branches are explicit and test-covered.
- Escape hatches: no Any, cast, type-ignore, broad exception handler, dynamic import, or sibling capability import.
- Defensive layers: none added; operation contracts are trusted.
- Recording ownership: exactly one session is finalized or discarded; no post-action re-query was added.
